  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that, velocity of light&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;is terms of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#1013;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math> is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msqrt></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mfrac><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Dimension of the magnetic field,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#964;</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>MA</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Again,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mi>I</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>MA</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>MLA</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>MLA</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>LT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>iii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>From Equations. (i), (ii) and (iii), we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#1013;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>LT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>MLA</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
